gumbo-parser
------------------------------------------
Gumbo is an implementation of the HTML5 parsing algorithm implemented as a pure
C99 library with no outside dependencies. It's designed to serve as a building
block for other tools and libraries such as linters, validators, templating
languages, and refactoring and analysis tools.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgumbo-devel-0.14.1-1bl1
  libgumbo4-0.14.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://codeberg.org/gumbo-parser/gumbo-parser

Canonical download:
  https://codeberg.org/gumbo-parser/gumbo-parser/archive/0.14.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack gumbo-parser-0.14.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./gumbo-parser-0.14.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/gumbo-parser-0.14.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/gumbo-parser-0.14.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgumbo4-0.14.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgumbo-devel-0.14.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(gumbo-parser)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/gumbo-parser.README
  /usr/share/doc/gumbo-parser/CHANGES.md
  /usr/share/doc/gumbo-parser/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/gumbo-parser/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/gumbo-parser/THANKS

(libgumbo4)
  /usr/bin/cyggumbo-4.dll

(libgumbo-devel)
  /usr/include/gumbo.h
  /usr/include/tag_enum.h
  /usr/lib/libgumbo.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/gumbo.pc

